 undergraduate and post graduate student body, most master brewers in the world's major breweries have a professional or educational relationship to Freising. Freising is the closest place of touristic interest to Munich Airport.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Freising","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Freising","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"facts":{"population":42570,"visit_h":6}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-freising-cathedral","name":"Freising Cathedral","kind":"Cathedral","lat":48.39893,"lon":11.7465,"dist_km":0.5,"rank_score":9.02,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Dom%20freising.jpg?width=960","author":"The original uploader was Violatan at German Wikipedia","licence":"CC BY-SA 2.0 de","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/de/deed.en","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dom_freising.jpg","w":2352,"h":3238,"ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-weihenstephan-abbey","name":"Weihenstephan Abbey","kind":"Monastery","lat":48.3949,"lon":11.7293,"dist_km":1.7,"rank_score":5.95,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Freising%20weihenstephan.jpg?width=960","author":"Violatan 11:26, 19. Jun. 2007 (CEST) (Transfered by vuxi/Original uploaded by Violatan)","licence":"Copyrighted free use","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Freising_weihenstephan.jpg","w":800,"h":600,"ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-freisinger-dom","name":"Freisinger Dom","kind":"Cathedral","lat":48.39892,"lon":11.74654,"dist_km":0.5,"sig":2.77,"rank_score":4.3,"resolved_by":"catalogue","fact":"Konkathedrale des römisch-katholischen Erzbistums München und Freising, Deutschland","image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Dom_freising.jpg/500px-Dom_freising.jpg?utm_source=de.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","author":"The original uploader was Violatan at German Wikipedia","licence":"CC BY-SA 2.0 de","